    "sections": {
        "description": "Auto Parts and Car Accessories is a modern, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress theme designed specifically for auto parts stores, car accessories shops, vehicle service centers, and automotive eCommerce websites. This WooCommerce-ready theme allows you to easily sell car spare parts, bike accessories, tools, tyres, batteries, engine parts, and automotive products online. Features include conversion-focused design, product filtering system, customer testimonials slider, brand showcase sections, and related products display. Fully compatible with Gutenberg block editor and WordPress Customizer, the theme offers easy customization of colors, fonts, headers, footers, and layouts without coding. SEO-optimized code structure, fast loading speeds, mobile-responsive design, RTL language support, and translation-ready functionality. Perfect for automotive retailers, spare parts dealers, car accessory shops, and vehicle service businesses."
    },
